<section class="content">

<h2>Student Workbook</h2>
<p class="big-question">For use after the lesson or in a group. Print this page or work in your notebook.</p>

<h3>Remembering the Essentials</h3>

<ol>
<li>What are the three degrees of Holy Orders? Briefly explain the function of each.</li>
<li>What is the difference between the common priesthood of all the baptized and the ministerial priesthood?</li>
<li>What does it mean that the priest acts <em>in persona Christi Capitis</em>?</li>
<li>When did Jesus institute the priesthood and with what words?</li>
<li>What is apostolic succession and why is it important?</li>
<li>What are the three offices (<em>munera</em>) of Christ exercised by the ordained minister?</li>
</ol>

</section>

