<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, Supreme and Eternal High Priest,<br />
I thank you for the gift of the priesthood.<br />
Bless the bishops, priests, and deacons<br />
you have placed in my path.<br />
Protect them from evil, comfort them in their trials,<br />
and help them live their ministry with joy and fidelity.<br />
Raise up in the Church many holy vocations<br />
to the priesthood and the consecrated life.<br />
And grant me the grace to live fully<br />
my own baptismal priesthood,<br />
offering my life each day for love.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

